    "title": "Donuts For Change: The Other Side Donuts - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Paulina Burnside ,\n6 hours ago Walking into The Other Side Donuts, one is greeted with walls of every color, encouraging motifs and toys that make you want to be a kid again. The remnants of a party can be seen bobbing around the ceiling in the form of birthday balloons, and cloud pop-outs glow softly from the ceiling. Customers have written their dreams on slips of paper and posted them up on a wall amongst iridescent streamers. A long case of donuts is displayed like an interactive museum where each section of flavors is its own miniature kingdom of frosting, glaze, fruit and candy. Read full article",
